{"id":"n3-106","title":"もしかすると〜かもしれない (moshikasuru to 〜kamoshirenai)","jlptLevel":3,"shortExplanation":"Express the possibility of something; 'maybe', 'perhaps', 'might'.","longExplanation":"The もしかすると〜かもしれない grammar point is used to indicate that there might be a possibility of a certain situation happening or someone feeling a certain way. This structure is often used to describe uncertain situations and can be translated into English as 'maybe', 'perhaps', or 'might'.","formation":"もしかすると + Sentence + かもしれない","examples":[{"jp":"もしかすると彼は遅刻するかもしれない。","romaji":"Moshikasuru to kare wa chikoku suru kamoshirenai.","en":"Maybe he might be late.","words":[{"surface":"もしか","vocabId":null},{"surface":"する","vocabId":"1595910","reading":"する"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"遅刻","vocabId":"1422050","reading":"ちこく"},{"surface":"する","vocabId":"1595910","reading":"する"},{"surface":"かも","vocabId":null},{"surface":"しれ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]},{"jp":"もしかすると彼女は疲れているかもしれない。","romaji":"Moshikasuru to kanojo wa tsukarete iru kamoshirenai.","en":"Perhaps she might be tired.","words":[{"surface":"もしか","vocabId":null},{"surface":"する","vocabId":"1595910","reading":"する"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"彼女","vocabId":"1483150","reading":"かのじょ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"疲れ","vocabId":"1483730","reading":"つかれ"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いる","vocabId":"1577980","reading":"いる"},{"surface":"かも","vocabId":null},{"surface":"しれ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]},{"jp":"もしかすると雨が降るかもしれない。","romaji":"Moshikasuru to ame ga furu kamoshirenai.","en":"It might rain, maybe.","words":[{"surface":"もしか","vocabId":null},{"surface":"する","vocabId":"1595910","reading":"する"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"雨","vocabId":"1171900","reading":"あめ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"降る","vocabId":"1282790","reading":"ふる"},{"surface":"かも","vocabId":null},{"surface":"しれ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]},{"jp":"もしかすると彼らはその映画が好きじゃないかもしれない。","romaji":"Moshikasuru to karera wa sono eiga ga suki janai kamoshirenai.","en":"Maybe they might not like that movie.","words":[{"surface":"もしか","vocabId":null},{"surface":"する","vocabId":"1595910","reading":"する"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"彼ら","vocabId":"1483090","reading":"かれら"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"その","vocabId":null},{"surface":"映画","vocabId":"1173720","reading":"えいが"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"好き","vocabId":"1277450","reading":"すき"},{"surface":"じゃ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"かも","vocabId":null},{"surface":"しれ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]}]}